## Library publishing rules (system-agnostic — keep)

1. The Plugin API **cannot** publish a library — a human clicks **Publish Library** in the Figma UI.
2. After publishing, consumer files see new content via `importComponentByKeyAsync` /
   `importStyleByKeyAsync` / `variables.importVariableByKeyAsync`.
3. Existing consumer instances don't auto-update layout — swap them (`figma-gotchas.md` Gotcha #20).
4. Before publishing, run the binding audit (Gotcha #27) — zero unbound colors is the gate.

